id: pm-csv-release-caller-rollout
title: Adopt the released reusable Daily Release caller
description: "Fleet rollout for unbraind/pm-ops#272 after the successful pm-jira cross-repository OIDC pilot. Replace copied release orchestration with the released SHA caller, matching validator, explicit empty changelog hooks and package-owned caller contracts. No merge, dispatch or publication."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: "area:release","gh:unbraind/pm-csv#257","gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
created_at: "2026-11-14T21:39:37.332Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-16T20:26:59.454Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-16T20:26:59.441Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-16T20:26:59.441Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
resolution: Implemented and merged in #257 (63f37ad).
expected_result: The change described by this item is on main.
actual_result: "Merged in #257 as 63f37ad; checks successful at head 0a966e8: CodeQL, codeql, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan, test (22), test (26)."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:39:43.672Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T21:47:41.190Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 56/56, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-15T00:16:38.158Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 audit found release-copy remnants or package-level regression tests needing restoration. Keep the pinned caller and package hooks; remove obsolete local release orchestration and stale references, restore independent package behavior tests, and retarget mutation proofs to the caller contract. Run touched tests, unchanged coverage gates, typecheck and lint, then regenerate and check the changelog after final tracker writes. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread actions."
  "2026-11-15T01:06:37.872Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/pull/257: Removed the obsolete YAML verifier that falsely required the deleted alert job. Retained the canonical alert-script input, package alert hook and behavior tests. Targeted tests passed 21/21. Full npm run coverage certification is delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds. npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed. Retirement contract passes and restoring only a retired artefact fails in a disposable copy. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker, keeping run artefacts outside this tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final tracker write. CI must verify the pushed head; no merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-15T02:46:21.220Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 CI follow-up: canonical tag lookup can return unverified-offline. The old inline-publisher success-message assertion then fails despite a valid caller. Update the package attestation test to assert structured recognition, require an explicit deferral without an attestation claim offline, and preserve all refusal checks. Prove it with forced offline execution in a disposable Git fixture; keep coverage source inventory and thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-11-15T03:01:18.049Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Round 2 attestation follow-up: targeted tests passed 29/29, including the retained caller and package behavior contracts. Forced offline verification explicitly reports unverified-offline and defers attestation; it never claims verified provenance. In a disposable Git fixture, the fixed assertion passes, reverting only to the old assertion fails, and restoring the fix passes. Unattested-publish refusal checks remain intact. Typecheck and lint passed; coverage source inventory and thresholds remain unchanged. Linked tests passed in a copied scratch tracker. Regenerate and check the changelog after this final write. Exact pushed-head npm/Bun coverage and release certification remain CI gates. No merge, release dispatch, publication or review-thread action."
  "2026-11-15T16:29:12.047Z",codex-sol,"Auditing the runtime-version stamp removed by the reusable release migration (pm-csv#257). Will preserve the released shared workflow pin, add the package preparation hook if required, and prove scratch-version build parity plus failure with the fix reverted. No review-thread changes, merges, or releases."
  "2026-11-15T16:36:30.671Z",codex-sol,"Real scratch-version build passes at 2099.1.2-3; package and manifest match the built runtime. Reverting only the prepare-script input makes that same build test fail specifically on the stale runtime assertion; the caller was then restored. Typecheck, build:test and docstrings passed. Lint passed. Latest npm tarball runtime matches package/manifest; exact fleet evidence is recorded in the audit documentation."
  "2026-11-15T16:39:32.651Z",codex-sol,"Final targeted gates passed: npm run typecheck; node --test test/release-runtime-version.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts (9/9, zero skipped); npm run changelog:check. The combined command was run through pm test with progress in source workspace and tracker context. npm run build:test and npm run docstring also passed; npm run lint passed. Revert proof repeated after the final implementation: removing only the caller hook fails the stale built-runtime assertion; restored caller passes. No full coverage or npm/Bun publication certification is claimed. Claims released for orchestrator review; items remain in_progress."
  "2026-11-15T19:58:40.831Z",codex-sol-round-d,"Round D: inspecting assigned failing CI logs and complete PR diff; preserve append-only tracker history and all release/privacy contracts."
  "2026-11-15T20:16:57.567Z",codex-sol-round-d,"Round D: test (22), run 43736953813, failed in the recently merged main acceptance harness: sleeping grandchild must be dead. Synchronized origin/main without rewriting branch history or tracker records. The cleanup test now requires two stopped observations of both descendants with a scaled five-second watchdog. Local reproduction also exposed fixture startup timeouts; deadline fixtures allow ten seconds, cancellation startup twenty seconds, runner sixty seconds, with nested fixture lifetimes scaled. Production process-tree termination and budgets are unchanged. Linked acceptance/runtime/caller tests passed 19/19 (33001 ms), zero skips; remaining packaging, alert and attestation/date tests passed in the focused run. Linked typecheck, build:test and lint passed. Strict unique-key YAML parsed eight files; verify:release-workflow passed 7/7. Removing only the stable-observation condition fails the deterministic regression; restoration passes. No covered source was edited in this follow-up, so no coverage rerun. Exact pushed-head CI remains unverified; no thread actions or release operations."
